# =============================================================================
# Git Ignore Configuration for ProwriteAI NLP Project
# =============================================================================

# --- Large Raw Datasets (Exceed GitHub 100 MB Limit) ---
# The raw Enron corpus is 1.36 GB uncompressed (358 MB compressed).
# Processed subsets (enron_clean.csv.gz and enron_sample_5000.csv) are tracked.
**/emails.csv/
**/emails.csv
**/emails.csv.zip
*.zip
*.tar.gz

# --- Historical Checkpoints & Backup Archive (2.3 GB) ---
# Contains older training runs (v1, v2, checkpointsv3, etc.).
# The 4 production checkpoints (A_LSTM, B_BiLSTM, C_Attention, D_Pointer)
# in prowrite_outputs/checkpoints/ (~7-14 MB each) are tracked.
**/Les anciens essai/
**/Les anciens essai/**

# --- Python & Bytecode ---
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class
*.so

# --- Jupyter Notebooks Checkpoints ---
.ipynb_checkpoints/

# --- Virtual Environments ---
venv/
.venv/
env/
ENV/
env.bak/
venv.bak/

# --- OS & Editor Metadata ---
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
*.swp
*.swo
.idea/
.vscode/

# --- Temporary Logs & Artifacts ---
*.log
